"“You're likely to see a strong affinity between safety preconditions and the "
"rules of Safe Rust.”"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/safety-preconditions/getter.md:26
msgid "Ask: “What are the safety preconditions of `get`?”"
msgstr ""

